{"id":"e21bed5fcec14186","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-banach-alaoglu.md","title":"Banach–Alaoglu Theorem","display":"thm-banach-alaoglu — Banach–Alaoglu Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-banach-alaoglu","aliases":["58-thm-banach-alaoglu"],"display":"thm-banach-alaoglu — Banach–Alaoglu Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-weak-topology.md]]","[[58-df-normed-vector]]","[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-banach-alaoglu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-banach-alaoglu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-banach-alaoglu — Banach–Alaoglu Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"040766e915f9aff3\" href=\"?note=040766e915f9aff3\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-weak-topology.md\">../batch11/58-df-weak-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7da44596b6c13df1\" href=\"?note=7da44596b6c13df1\" title=\"58-df-normed-vector\">58-df-normed-vector</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (赋范空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7da44596b6c13df1\" href=\"?note=7da44596b6c13df1\" title=\"58-df-normed-vector\">58-df-normed-vector</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\)</span> (赋范空间谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> (连续对偶空间, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{X^*} = \\{f \\in X^* : \\|f\\| \\leq 1\\}\">\\(B_{X^*} = \\{f \\in X^* : \\|f\\| \\leq 1\\}\\)</span> (单位球)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(X^*,X)\">\\(\\sigma(X^*,X)\\)</span> (由评价映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto f(x)\">\\(f\\mapsto f(x)\\)</span> 生成的弱星拓扑)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (紧致性谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}alaoglu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(B_{X^*},\\sigma(X^*,X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}alaoglu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(B_{X^*},\\sigma(X^*,X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For separable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^*\">\\(w^*\\)</span>-topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> is metrizable on bounded sets.</li>\n<li>The topology is weak-star, not the weak topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(X^*,X^{**})\">\\(\\sigma(X^*,X^{**})\\)</span> on the dual space.</li>\n<li>Corollary: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> is reflexive iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_X\">\\(B_X\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>-compact (Kakutani).</li>\n<li>The theorem holds more generally for polars in locally convex spaces.</li>\n<li>Eberlein–Šmulian 对任意 Banach 空间中的子集刻画相对弱紧性，并非只适用于自反空间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-weak-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"040766e915f9aff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-weak-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normed-vector","status":"resolved","id":"7da44596b6c13df1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normed-vector]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normed-vector","status":"resolved","id":"7da44596b6c13df1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ (赋范空间, see [[58-df-normed-vector]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X^*$ (连续对偶空间, see [[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S$ (紧致性谓词, see [[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"B_{X^*} = \\{f \\in X^* : \\|f\\| \\leq 1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(X^*,X)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\mapsto f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}alaoglu} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(B_{X^*},\\sigma(X^*,X))","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"w^*","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(X^*,X^{**})","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"B_X","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false}],"bytes":1391,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4040","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-banach-alaoglu.md|58-thm-banach-alaoglu]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["040766e915f9aff3","7da44596b6c13df1","c740b73b26d2ecf9","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}